; companion to load-export-labeled-fact-survives.kurt: an unlabelled fact (`R`, no string at
; all) or a `local`-labelled one (`Q`) must NOT be exported. Confirmed the opposite way: since
; neither symbol was ever seen by this file, re-declaring `bool` for both succeeds cleanly.
load load-export-helper
bool Q
bool R
true
